 experiences that bring together culture, trading, gaming, and entertainment. Our goal is bold and simple: make crypto accessible, exciting, and unforgettable for the next generation of users. Backed by top-tier investors including Electric Capital, Lightspeed Ventures and Paradigm, we’re a global team of passionate, scrappy, and wildly talented people who don’t believe in limits. If you’re ready to take on big challenges, own your impact, and help shape the next era of Web3, you’re in the right place.\n\nKey Responsibilities\n\nArchitect and develop scalable, event-driven backend systems using Node.js, TypeScript, and AWSDesign and optimize real-time data pipelines leveraging Kafka, Kinesis, or equivalent streaming technologiesLead end-to-end delivery from architecture and implementation to deployment and monitoring in productionCollaborate closely with Infrastructure, Product, and Data teams to solve complex challenges and accelerate deliverySet the technical vision for backend architecture, contributing to design reviews and mentoring other engineers\n\nQualifications & Skills\n\n6+ years of experience building and scaling backend systems in productionProven success with high-throughput, low-latency services in fintech, trading, or entertainment offeringsStrong foundation in distributed systems design, cloud infrastructure, and data streamingExperience leading large projects or small teams, balancing shipping speed with long-term system integrityA collaborative, hands-on mindset — someone who takes ownership, moves fast, and builds for scaleStrong preference for gaming / entertainment industry experienceBachelor's degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, relevant technical field, or equivalent practical experience\n\nWhy You’ll Love Working Here\n\nImpact from day one: Join at the ground floor — your code will shape the future of the platformLearn fast: Build alongside founders who scaled Magic Eden from idea to unicorn in just nine monthsInnovate at scale: Contribute to high-velocity systems that blend sports, markets, and Web3 innovationCulture built on accountability: Engineers here are self-directed, empowered, and own their outcomes end-to-endCompetitive compensation and equity: Be rewarded for the impact you drive at one of the fastest-scaling Web3 companies globally","attributesV2":[{"start":698,"length":22,"detailData":{"jobPostingName":null,"hyperlink":null,"profileFamiliarName":null,"color":null,"companyName":null,"icon":null,"epoch":null,"systemImage":null,"textLink":null,"listItemStyle":null,"groupName":null,"hyperlinkOpenExternally":null,"listStyle":null,"profileFullName":null,"stringFieldReference":null,"learningCourseName":null,"profileMention":null,"style":"BOLD","schoolName":null,"hashtag":null},"$recipeTypes":["com.linkedin.a86ec3a7ab50c2c801e0395a86ff19c0"],"$type":"com.linkedin.voyager.dash.common.text.TextAttribute"},{"start":720,"length":95,"detailData":{"jobPostingName":null,"hyperlink":null,"profileFamiliarName":null,"color":null,"companyName":null,"icon":null,"epoch":null,"systemImage":null,"textLink":null,"listItemStyle":null,"groupName":null,"hyperlinkOpenExternally":null,"listStyle":null,"profileFullName":null,"stringFieldReference":null,"learningCourseName":null,"profileMention":null,"style":"LIST_ITEM","schoolName":null,"hashtag":null},"$recipeTypes":["com.linkedin.a86ec3a7ab50c2c801e0395a86ff19c0"],"$type":"com.linkedin.voyager.dash.common.text.TextAttribute"},{"start":815,"length":108,"detailData":{"jobPostingName":null,"hyperlink":null,"profileFamiliarName":null,"color":null,"companyName":null,"icon":null,"epoch":null,"systemImage":null,"textLink":null,"listItemStyle":null,"groupName":null,"hyperlinkOpenExternally":null,"listStyle":null,"profileFullName":null,"stringFieldReference":null,"learningCourseName":null,"profileMention":null,"style":"LIST_ITEM","schoolName":null,"hashtag":null},"$recipeTypes":["com.linkedin.a86ec3a7ab50c2c801e0395a86ff19c0"],"$type":"com.linkedin.voyager.da